  "bodyHash": "abf524ce4ccaf500",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img title=\"朋友與敵人\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"朋友與敵人\" width=\"836\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"贊助咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成為 Patreon 會員\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入 Discord 伺服器\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 為生物投票中落選或被遺忘的生物增添新意。開發此模組的主要目標之一，是進一步擴展原始設計概念，並為所有新增生物加入符合原版風格的新特性。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t您可以查看 <a title=\"wiki\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">維基</a> 以獲得已實作生物與功能的詳細概覽。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"螃蟹\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"螃蟹\" width=\"60\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>螃蟹</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a>，一種在紅樹林沼澤與海灘間漫遊的友善生物。\n\t想要增加觸碰距離嗎？螃蟹鉤爪可用於調製一種能延長觸碰距離的藥水，讓您的冒險更具優勢。\n\t如果您想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\">繁殖</a> 這隻小家伙，您需要海帶與耐心，因為螃蟹需要將卵「埋」在安全的地方。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"揮手的螃蟹\" title=\"揮手的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"螃蟹攀爬紅樹林\" title=\"螃蟹攀爬紅樹林\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t其他與螃蟹相關的內容：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\">螃蟹鉤爪</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\">遠足</a> 狀態效果</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>凝灰岩傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一種體態優雅的生物，可以手持並展示您給它的任何物品，但請注意，當它沒有睡覺時，它喜歡來一場說走就走的散步。\n\t希望凝灰岩傀儡待在原處？使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\">蜂巢</a> 將其固定住即可。若想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\">建造</a> 這尊沉睡美人，請準備一塊凝灰岩石塊、任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\">顏色</a> 的羊毛塊以及南瓜。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"手持附魔書的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"手持附魔書的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"熟睡的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"熟睡的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"頑皮鬼\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"頑皮鬼\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>頑皮鬼</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t探索 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\">頑皮鬼</a>，一種棲息於礦坑中的淘氣小家伙，熱愛玩捉迷藏。\n\t它既愛玩樂又樂於助人，在您尋找時會給予提示。\n\t找到它三次後，它將會用您夢寐以求的<b>包裹</b>作為獎勵！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"礦坑中的頑皮鬼\" title=\"礦坑中的頑皮鬼\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"頑皮鬼丟出包裹\" title=\"頑皮鬼丟出包裹\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"銅傀儡\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"銅傀儡\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>銅傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t認識 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\">銅傀儡</a>，一種小巧可愛、充滿喜劇色彩的生物，最喜歡隨機按壓銅按鈕。\n\t與其他銅製品一樣，它會隨時間 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\">氧化</a>，但別擔心，維護起來輕鬆無憂！想要快速翻新，拿一把 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\">斧頭</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\">蜂巢</a> 即可。\n\t若想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\">建造</a> 這隻小家伙，請準備銅塊、南瓜與避雷針。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\" title=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"銅傀儡\" title=\"銅傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t其他與銅傀儡相關的內容：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\">銅傀儡工作站</a> 村莊結構</li>\n\t<li>所有銅製版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\">銅按鈕</a></li>\n\t<li>所有銅製版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\">避雷針</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img style=\"height: 40px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" title=\"瞪眼怪\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"瞪眼怪\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>瞪眼怪</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\">瞪眼怪</a>，一種居住在繁茂洞穴中、性格暴躁卻可愛、極度厭惡黑暗的苔蘚夥伴。\n\t同樣厭惡黑暗嗎？瞪眼怪可以為您標示出足以生成怪物的黑暗區域。\n\t若想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\">馴服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\">繁殖</a> 這隻小家伙，您需要螢光莓果，但要小心，瞪眼怪會經常偷吃它們，通常不會留下剩餘的。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"幼體與成體瞪眼怪\" title=\"幼體與成體瞪眼怪\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"飛翔於繁茂洞穴中的瞪眼怪\" title=\"飛翔於繁茂洞穴中的瞪眼怪\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"冰術師\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"冰術師\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>冰術師</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遇見 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\">冰術師</a>，一位孤身一人、深居雪原的災厄村民。\n\t您可以在樹林中搜尋一座小型雲杉 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">小屋</a> 來找到他。\n\t但冒險時請務必小心，多年的荒野生活讓他的心比周圍的冰霜更為寒冷。一旦被他發現，請準備好迎戰 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰霜攻擊</a>，這將使您的冒險變成一場嚴寒挑戰。\n</p>\t\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雪原中的冰術師小屋\" title=\"雪原中的冰術師小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"冰術師攻擊村民\" title=\"冰術師攻擊村民\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t其他與冰術師相關的內容：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰術師小屋</a> 結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\">冰凍圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"花牛\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"花牛\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>花牛</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t隆重推出 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">花牛</a>，一種沐浴著陽光、周身綴滿美麗花朵的牛，主要生活在花叢森林中。\n\t這些披覆鮮花的夥伴不僅賞心悅目，還能與蜜蜂產生和諧共生的效應。\n\t當它們行走時，會留下一串綻放的花徑，讓每一步都成為探索自然奇觀的迷人旅程。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"金盞花花牛\" title=\"金盞花花牛\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁花花牛\" title=\"繁花花牛\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t其他與花牛相關的內容：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\">金盞花</a> 花朵</li>\n\t<li>所有木材版本的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\">蜂箱</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\">養蜂人區域</a> 村莊結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\">養蜂人</a> 村民職業</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"野火\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"野火\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>野火</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\">野火</a>，烈焰的主宰，受到四面護盾的保護。\n\t這將是一場非友好的遭遇，請警惕它的護盾碎片暴風雨與撼動大地的震波攻擊。\n\t被逼入絕境時，它會召喚烈焰人以作為援軍。在它的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">要塞</a> 領地中，運用策略征服這項挑戰吧。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"下界中的要塞結構\" title=\"下界中的要塞結構\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"要塞中的野火\" title=\"要塞中的野火\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t其他與野火相關的內容：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">要塞</a> 結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\">野火皇冠</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\">野火皇冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"噬獸（大飢餓）\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"噬獸\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>噬獸（大飢餓）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\">噬獸</a>，一種穿梭於稀樹草原、惡地與沙漠的小型掠食者。它們正積極搜尋雞、兔子等獵物。\n\t您可以餵食附魔食物來 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\">儲存經驗值</a>，之後再用玻璃瓶提取。但請注意，儲存的經驗值越多，噬獸就會變得越大、越饑渴！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"噬獸追捕雞隻\" title=\"噬獸追捕雞隻\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\"  alt=\"餵食的噬獸\" title=\"餵食的噬獸\" title=\"餵食的噬獸\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"幻術師\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"幻術師\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>幻術師</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遇見 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\">幻術師</a>，一位手持弓箭、狡詐多變的騙術師，棲息於針葉林中。您可以在小木屋或他的訓練場附近搜尋他的蹤跡。\n\t接近時請保持警惕，因為他的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\">致盲咒語</a> 可能會讓您陷入一片漆黑，難以分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\">幻象</a> 與現實。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"針葉林中的幻術師小木屋\" title=\"針葉林中的幻術師小木屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"訓練場中的幻術師\" title=\"訓練場中的幻術師\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t其他與幻術師相關的內容：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\">幻術師小木屋</a> 結構</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\">幻象圖騰</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"殭屍馬（陷阱）\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"殭屍馬（陷阱）\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>殭屍馬（陷阱）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t曾經想騎乘 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\">殭屍馬</a> 嗎？如果是，請在雷暴天氣靠近牠，奇蹟可能就此發生——您甚至可能一睹四騎士的真容。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷暴中的殭屍馬\" title=\"雷暴中的殭屍馬\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷暴中的四騎士\" title=\"雷暴中的四騎士\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 相容性 / 擴充模組</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 旨在與所有其他模組完全相容，目前提供以下擴充模組與數據包：\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-forge\">Friends&amp;Foes - Flowery Mooblooms</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge\">Friends&amp;Foes - Beekeeper Hut</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes Compat Datapack</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\">CTOV - Friends and Foes Compat Datapack</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社群</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t歡迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我們的 Discord 社群</a>，在此聊天、分享您的創作、提出任何問題，或單純追蹤模組的最新開發進度，並在有新版本發布時獲得通知。\n\t也請不要猶豫，透過 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\">GitHub Issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>👋 支持</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t我會繼續將開發模組視為興趣，因為我真心享受其中。如果您想支持我，可以透過 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a>。非常感謝您的支持。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 授權條款</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t本模組採用 <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 授權條款。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t歡迎瀏覽我的程式碼，了解我在開發此模組時如何應對與解決各種挑戰。您完全可以將程式碼片段融入自己的專案中。也歡迎在任何模組包中使用本模組（若能註明出處或連結回此頁面將不勝感激）。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t您也可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\">blockbench 目錄</a>（包含所有模型與配色）以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\">textures 目錄</a> 以取得貼圖。歡迎汲取靈感，但請不要直接複製貼上並將之據為己有。\n</p>",
